 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/P1040494.jpg\" alt=\"found gold detecting on the beach\" title=\"minelab equinox gold found on the beach\" width=\"610\" height=\"458\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "More gold found with the Minelab Equinox 800"
  },
  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "metal detecting the beach at cleethorpes."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Early morning on the beach today as high tide was so early. Setting the Equinox into beach mode 2 and sensitivity to 23, 5 tones are my personal favourite and manual ground balance. Iron Bias set to 5 recovery speed set to 6, and iron discrimination upto 2 on the tone breaks and then run in all metal mode as this beach has lots of shallow iron so these settings help alot."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The gold came in at number 9-10 on the middle of the slope."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "video coming soon."
  },
  {
